[7.492423, "o", "Night gate stayed green after a published type grew a required argument. Opening the desk unit alone still reports arity. A full flood of /app/corpus disagrees with nudge on that tree. Live copies for restore sit under /app/seed/corpus and /app/seed/blot. Corpus units: api/Bond.u api/Kin.u api/LocalAid.u api/Vest.u desk/Clerk.u desk/Watch.u wire/Port.u. Same-package identifier use of a published type counts as naming it.\r\n"]
